Package: libupnp0
Priority: extra
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Intel Universal Plug And Play SDK for Linux (shared libraries)
 The Linux SDK for UPnP Devices (libupnp) provides developers with an
 API and open source code for building control points, devices, and
 bridges that are compliant with Version 1.0 of the Universal Plug and
 Play Device Architecture Specification - see http://www.upnp.org/ for
 specifications.
 .
 The libupnp0 package contains the runtime libraries for uPnP.
Section: libs

Package: libupnp-dev
Priority: extra
Architecture: any
Depends: libupnp0, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Intel Universal Plug And Play SDK for Linux (development files)
 The Linux SDK for UPnP Devices (libupnp) provides developers with an
 API and open source code for building control points, devices, and
 bridges that are compliant with Version 1.0 of the Universal Plug and
 Play Device Architecture Specification - see http://www.upnp.org/ for
 specifications.
 .
 The libupnp-dev package contains the header files, documentation and
 debug versions of libraries needed for development of programs using
 uPnP.
Section: libdevel

Package: nas-upnp
Priority: extra
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Infrant uPnP NAS daemon
 .
 The nas-upnp package contains the uPnP daemon for Infrant NAS products.
